{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-62"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-talk-403815452-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 「초월의 거울」의 거대한 조각을 보았다. 조각 아래에는 세 개의 촛불이 놓여있었다","talkId":403815452,"textHash":"17779749026534001889","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/talk-403815452","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3f7c8f0d066ecfaf","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-talk-403815456-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「참으로 오랫동안 이 깨진 거울에 갇혀 있었군」 거울을 안은 자가 말했다. 「『미(美)』를 믿는다면, 네 소원을 들어주겠노라」","talkId":403815456,"textHash":"5919672762375618020","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/talk-403815456","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e8ae6d3d75f94e0c","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-text-6806213887617381295-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"원하는 것을 속으로 생각한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"6806213887617381295","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/text-6806213887617381295","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"83814885f71d0465","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-text-13610392172481139705-effect"],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-text-13610392172481139705-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"랜덤 보상을 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13610392172481139705","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/text-13610392172481139705","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"83814885f71d0465","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)","bwikiReplyToIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-text-6806213887617381295-choice"]},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-text-6245564956865282937-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"그녀가 거울에서 나오는 소원을 빈다","talkId":null,"textHash":"6245564956865282937","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/text-6245564956865282937","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3416ca1302c46ed3","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-62-text-4786099974575972323-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-62","missionId":"event-rogue-62","mission":"초월의 거울 (1)","scene":"초월의 거울 (1)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"당신은 소원을 빌고 싶지 않다","talkId":null,"textHash":"4786099974575972323","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:62/text-4786099974575972323","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b31edccd3e555bca","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"超验之镜（其一）","bwikiRevision":92654,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9334","bwikiMission":"초월의 거울 (1)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["gold-and-gears-event-r